    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FP formats offer a typically larger data range and higher precision for small values but have lower precision for large values and potentially higher hardware costs.</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
