    <hasEvidenceChunk rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2308.13137_rag::chunk_001</hasEvidenceChunk>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">reducing the memory bottleneck preeminently important. Further analysis shows that the memory bottleneck is strongly related to context size.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">requirement of at least five A100-80G GPUs for inference. This significant demand for computational resources and associated communication overheads impedes the practical deployment</hasEvidenceText>
