    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">potentially hindering their generalization to larger ones ( e.g., LLAMA-7B [ Touvron et al. , 2023 ] with 7B parameters)</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
