    <hasEvidenceChunk rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2305.12356_rag::chunk_005</hasEvidenceChunk>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">the relative effectiveness of INT and FP quantization remains ambiguous, motivating an interesting question: Considering that INT and FP formats with the same bit width</hasEvidenceText>
