    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">it would not be a good guidance for the student. Hence, we verify that using posterior is more useful than activations in terms of training a low-precision network.</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/S0/R1#simulates_during">
