    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">we can verify the resource constraints by our latency/energy lookup table to avoid the direct interaction with the target hardware. Given a resource budget, we directly eliminate the candidates that exceed the constraints.</hasEvidenceText>
