    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">adopting strategies like clipping ( Banner et al. , 2019 ; McKinstry et al. , 2019 ; Choukroun et al. , 2019 ) or value splitting ( Zhao et al. , 2019 ) for weights and activations to improve the precision</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
